%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
% readme_Lorenz_PSD_PDF_t.txt
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
In this directory we plot figures for the Lorenz system;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
\Lorenz_graphs\Lorenz_PSD_PDF_t\ -> Here we plot the PSD for Lorenz system, for
the original system, and for NGRC DDE system learned from the Lorenz system;
We here also plot the PDF for both cases, the original Lorenz system, and for 
the NGRC DDE system learned from Lorenz system; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Lorenz_psd_pdf_v.m -> this file plots the graph;
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Xvt4t.mat -> tis is a data file containing the results of computation of 
original Lorenz system; here are dynamics of variable x(t);
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tesc_XP5t.mat -> tis is a data file containing the results of computation of 
NGRC DDE system learned by Lorenz system; here are dynamics of replicated 
variable x(t);
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
%---NOTE!!!----------------------------------------------------------------
The time series for NGRC DDE system (learned from the chaotic Lorenz system)
is computed in /Fig2_aux/Fig2_aux_Tesc/ by file [Lorenz_scan_esc_Lc_aut_v2t.m];
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
WelchPowerSpectralDensity.m -> this is a function that computes the PSD of
a given time series using the FFT algorithm; 
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hann.m -> this is an auxiliary function; it is used by the function
[WelchPowerSpectralDensity.m];
%--------------------------------------------------------------------------
  
